  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :&nbsp;</strong></span> has released the exam city details for the Nursing Officer Common Eligibility Test 2026 (NORCET-11th) on its official website.&nbsp;This <span class=\"google-anno-t\">recruitment</span> was released for 2218 posts. Applications for AIIMS NORCET 11th Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 24 July 2026 to 13 August 2026. The Stage – I examination is going to be conducted in 12 September 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their AIIMS NORCET 11th Exam City Details 2026 from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">All India Institute of Medical Science AIIMS</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">AIIMS NORCET 11th Exam City Details 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Notice No.103/2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>24 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>13 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date :<strong>&nbsp;August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Stage-I Exam Date : <strong>12 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>03 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Stage-II Exam Date : <strong>30 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result : <strong>Will be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC :<strong> Rs. 3000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, EWS : <strong>Rs. 2400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH Candidates : <strong>Rs. 00/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>AIIMS NORCET 11th Phase Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 13 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per AIIMS NORCET 11th Phase Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Use<span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; color: #0000ff;\">  </span>Tool – <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>AIIMS NORCET 11th Phase 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 2218</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 53.115%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6471%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.2378%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 53.115%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"5\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Nursing Officer Recruitment Common Eligibility Test 2026 (NORCET-11th)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6471%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.2378%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">–</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6471%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.2378%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">–</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6471%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.2378%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">–</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6471%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.2378%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">–</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 23.6471%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.2378%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">–</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>AIIMS NORCET 11th Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Education Qualification</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates B.Sc (Hons) Nursing / B.Sc Nursing / Diploma in Nursing Midwifery from Indian Nursing Council / State Nursing Council from any recognized Institute / University in India with Steno &amp; Typing Knowledge will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates should have Diploma in General Nursing Midwifery and Registered as a Nursery and Midwife in State / Nursing Council with 02 Year Experience in 50 Bedded Hospital will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For more information, please check the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>AIIMS NORCET 11th Phase Recruitment 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Stage-I : Pre CBT Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Stage-II : Mains CBT Exam</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download AIIMS NORCET 11th Exam City Details 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their exam city details candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their exam city details.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their exam city details.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also check their exam city details from official site of the AIIMS.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow Our Instagram Channel</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></