 exam city details.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is AIIMS Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer. </strong>The Official Website of AIIMS is https://www.aiimsexams.ac.in/</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
